  "title": "Spicy Lime and Dill Grilled Fish",
  "description": "This recipe for grilling fish with dill and lemon juice in a foil packet is a tidy way to cook fish on the grill without the mess.",
  "authors": [
    "Ginny Maziarka"
  ],
